.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s11","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"On Fashion-MNIST, ResNet-50 obtains a validation accuracy of 69.7% (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s12","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"Figure 3 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s13","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"VGG-16 achieves 69.7% validation accuracy on SVHN (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s14","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"As shown in Figure 3, Baseline outperforms MobileNet by 52.5 percentage points on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s15","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"On AG News, MobileNet obtains a validation accuracy of 131.2% (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s16","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"Baseline outperforms VGG-16 by 7 percentage points on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s17","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"Figure 4 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s18","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"On SST-2, Transformer obtains a F1 score of 90% (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s19","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"As shown in Figure 4, on IMDB, ResNet-50 obtains a F1 score of 101.1%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s20","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"On IMDB, Transformer is 6.7 points better than ResNet-50 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s21","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"Transformer outperforms ResNet-50 by 13 percentage points on SVHN (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s22","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"On AG News, Naive Bayes obtains an accuracy of 50.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_017_s23","report_id":"holdout2_017","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}